{"words": [{"text": "وَإِذْ", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "وَٰعَدْنَا", "translation": "We appointed"}, {"text": "مُوسَىٰٓ", "translation": "(for) Musa"}, {"text": "أَرْبَعِينَ", "translation": "forty"}, {"text": "لَيْلَةًۭ", "translation": "nights"}, {"text": "ثُمَّ", "translation": "Then"}, {"text": "ٱتَّخَذْتُمُ", "translation": "you took"}, {"text": "ٱلْعِجْلَ", "translation": "the calf"}, {"text": "مِنۢ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "بَعْدِهِۦ", "translation": "after him"}, {"text": "وَأَنتُمْ", "translation": "and you"}, {"text": "ظَـٰلِمُونَ", "translation": "(were) wrongdoers"}], "sahih": "And [recall] when We made an appointment with Moses for forty nights. Then you took [for worship] the calf after him [i.e., his departure], while you were wrongdoers."}